Date: Thu, 14 Mar 2024 01:52:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] com.amd: AMD OEM RAS configuration interface added

This commit introduces an AMD OEM interface that enables the setting
and retrieval of configuration parameters used by the RAS application.
For more details on the AMD RAS feature, please refer to the design
document uploaded for review.
https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/docs/+/68440

Change-Id: I51d4addfbc2231a3dcd5533033a693f882f0200f
Signed-off-by: Abinaya Dhandapani <adhandap@amd.com>
